3. sta lis e t of t e iversity.- (l) There shall be established aUniversity to be called The Margalla Intemational University, located at Islamabad, inthe Private sector.
(2) The University shall be a body corporate having perpetual succession anda common seal with powsr to acquire, hold and dispose of properly and shall, by thesaid name, sue and be sued.
