i. provide for education and scholarship in such branches of knowledge as itmay deem fit, and to make provision for research, service to society and forthe application, advancement and dissemination of knowledge in suchmanner as it may determine. Provided that the Board shall be competent toapprovs faculties and deparffnents on the recommendation of AcademicCouncil as it may determine, subject to the approval of the relevant statutorybody of a professional education, where applicable. Make provisions for thevirtual and distance learning educational programs;ii. prescribe courses of studies to be conducted by it and the constituentcolleges/institutes;iii. offer joint degree programs in collaboration with national and internationaluniversities and educational institutions subject to prior approval of theCommission;iv. establish programs for the exchange of students and teachers between theUniversity and other universities, educational institutions and researchorganization, inside as well as outside Pakistan;v. accept the examinations passed and the period of study spent by students ofthe University at other universities and places of learning equivalent to suchexaminations and periods of study in the Universrt5r, as it may prescribe, andto withdraw such acceptance;vi. establish, maintain and administer departrnents, constituent colleges,constituent instifutes, centers of excellence, laboratories, workshops, offtces

