23. A t orities o t e ersi .-:The following shall be the Authorities ofthe University:(a) Board of Governors;(b) the Executive Committee;(c) Academic Council;(d) Faoulties;(e) Boards of Faculties;(0 Board of Advanced Studies and Research;(g) Boards of Studies;(h) Departments;(i) Selection Board;O Finance and Planning Committee;ft) Discipline Commiffee;(l) the Representation committees for appointment to the Board ofGovernors, the Executive committee and the Academic council; and(m) Such other Authorities as may be prescribed by Regulations.
Z . oar of overnors.{l) The Board of Governors of the Universityshall consist ofthe following:(a) A Director of the company, to be nominated by the BoD, shall be theChairman of the Board;(b) Directors of the Company subject to a maximum of four Directors to benominated by the Cornpany;(c) Two persons from academia and industry each one of whom is an expert inany of the fields of knowledge to be nominated by the Chairman of the Board;(d) Secretary to the Governmen! Federal Education Department or hisnominee;(e) Chairman ofthe Commission or his nominee;(f) A Vice Chancellor of a Federal university of Pakistan to be nominated bythe Patron;(g) Rector ofthe University;(h) Pro-Rector of the University; and(i) Registrar (Secretary).(Z) Members of the Board other than ex-fficio members shall hold office for aterm of three years and shall be eligible for re-appointment on the expiry of their termofoffice.(3) The quorum for a meeting of the Board shall be one-half of the totalnumber of members with at least two ex-fficio members, a fraction being counted asone.(4) The Secretary shall, with the approval of the Chairman of the Board, call ameeting of the Board.

