7.6
University or any Authority, officer or employee of the Universilv or any person inrespect of anything which is done in good faith under the Act.
SA CSAN ASNSThe purpose and objects of the establishment of The Margalla Intemational Universitv, isto promote and disseminate the knowledge and to provide education, training, research,demonstration and scholarship in such branches of learning, as it may determine. For thispurpose, the application and advancement as well as dissemination of knowledge in fieldof Engineering & Sciences, Computing and Information Technology, 'fextile Sciencesand Engineering Technologies, Health and Medical Sciences, Allied Health and Sciences,Agriculture and Allied Science, Pharmacy, Applied Sciences, Architecture and UrbanSciences, Business Administration, Public Administration, Media Studies, Education,Social Sciences, Law, Linguistics, Medicine, Commerce and other Faculties as may beprescribed by the Statutes. To determine courses for study at the under graduate andhigher levels in its constituents units and institutions shall be obtained and liaison withother research or academic organizations shall be made to achieve the targets. Further,Industry, and the relevant organizations or institutions to promote public privatepartnership, innovation and researc[ development, industrialization for the purpose ofeducation, training development shall be made. This Bill seeks to achieve the aforesaidobjectives.
Dr. Ramesh KumarVankwaniMember, National Assembly

endstream
